---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About WAG Podcast"
  description="What WAG Podcast actually is: a weekly, video-first talk show hosted by three teen girls, its format, its topics, and how it fits into The Wild Adventure Girls."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="hero-photo">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/images/studio/wag-studio-428.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img src="/images/studio/wag-studio-428.jpg" alt="Angelina, Scarlett, and Annabella backstage at the WAG Podcast studio" fetchpriority="high" />
      </picture>
      <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>What WAG Podcast actually is.</h1>
      <p class="lede">The show, the format, and how it fits into the wider Wild Adventure Girls world.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-body">
    <div class="container" data-reveal="stagger">
      <div class="about-block">
        <h2>A weekly, unscripted talk show</h2>
        <p>WAG Podcast is a weekly video podcast hosted by Angelina, Scarlett, and Annabella. Every episode is filmed in their own studio — no writers' room, no script. It's the same real dynamic the three of them have off camera, just with a mic on: trending topics, viral dares, fan questions, and the kind of behind-the-scenes stories that don't make it into a normal video.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block">
        <h2>Video-first, not audio-only</h2>
        <p>Most podcasts are built for audio and treat video as an afterthought. WAG Podcast is the opposite — full episodes are shot for YouTube first, then released as audio-only versions on Spotify and Apple Podcasts for anyone who'd rather just listen. If you've never watched a podcast before, this is built to be watched.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block">
        <h2>What topics come up</h2>
        <p>There's no fixed theme episode to episode — that's on purpose, since real conversations don't work that way. Recurring territory includes trending topics and pop culture, friendship and relationship questions, real talk about tough stuff, party games and challenges, and behind-the-scenes stories from filming Wild Adventure Girls content.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block">
        <h2>How it relates to The Wild Adventure Girls</h2>
        <p>WAG Podcast is published by <a href="https://wildadventuregirls.com/">The Wild Adventure Girls</a> — the teen entertainment brand Angelina, Scarlett, and Annabella built on YouTube making adventure, mystery-investigation, and challenge content. The podcast is a separate show with its own format and its own weekly release, not a repackaged version of that content. Full episode-by-episode coverage — every episode's own page, topic hubs, and companion articles — lives on the main WAG site; this site is the show's own home.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block">
        <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
        <p>Angelina, Scarlett, and Annabella are real sisters and a cousin, not a cast brought together for a show. <a href="/hosts/">Meet the hosts →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/watch/">Watch an Episode →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/listen/">Listen Now →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero{ position:relative; padding: 0 0 32px; }
  .hero-photo{ position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio: 2.6/1; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .hero-photo img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position: center 30%; display:block; }
  .hero-scrim{ position:absolute; inset:0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(10,10,15,.75) 0%, transparent 45%); }
  .hero-inner{ max-width:68ch; }
  .about-hero h1{ font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.1rem); max-width:20ch; }
  .lede{ font-size:1.1rem; max-width:60ch; }

  .about-body{ padding: 48px 0; }
  .about-block{ max-width:70ch; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .about-block h2{ font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:.5em; }
  .about-block p{ font-size:1rem; }
  .about-block a{ color: var(--wag-green); font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline; }

  .about-cta{ padding: 8px 0 72px; display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:40px; }
  .btn-outline{ border-color: var(--ink); }
  .btn-outline:hover{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--bg); }
</style>
